nvidia-kmod-legacy-580xx (580.196.07-1+sparky2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * NVIDIA's 580 user space now comes from the edition's repository, carried
    from NVIDIA's own Debian 12 packages at this package's version
    (nvidia-legacy-580xx-userspace, ORDER 354 milestone 2). The module
    provides nvidia-kernel-dkms at its own version, which is the carried
    user space's, and recommends nvidia-driver at it; NVIDIA's packages
    depend on nvidia-kernel-dkms at their exact version.
  * The lock's README says where the user space comes from.

